# Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from your Supabase project dashboard:
# https://app.supabase.com/project/_/settings/api

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Local `eas build` runs `npx expo config` on your machine first, so a gitignored
# .env (or .env.local) here must define the two variables above. Also define them
# in https://expo.dev → your project → Environment variables for each EAS profile
# so the remote builder receives them. Missing values fail in app.config.ts
# instead of shipping an app that crashes on launch.
